# PR#9: real, deliberate, and already named where it is taken. `ClaimSessions` passes a
# zero min-idle on purpose (`stream.go`, and the comment there says so): the new owner
# holds the lease, so whoever held those entries has lost it, and waiting the delay would
# put the abandoned command after the newer one every time, which is the reordering the
# call exists to prevent. What is left is the heartbeat or so between a lease moving and
# the old owner noticing. The suggested fix does not close it: a reservation taken before
# the side effect says an attempt was made, never whether it landed, so an instance that
